//@version=6
// Stryker built-in copy of "WCSMC + SP v3.0 [WinWorld]" (source: pastebin mXhKkyAU, Owner order 2026-10-07).
// Stryker edits (each line marked "Stryker edit"), site rules: no trade signals, no performance claims.
//  - Removed: OB-based entry labels, TP/SL boxes and group, the performance dashboard (wins/losses,
//    win rate, PnL), the entry/TP/SL alerts, and the entry-only Gate / Signal Behavior settings.
//  - MTF dashboard says Bullish / Bearish; its timeframes are capped at 1D.
//  - SMT auto pairing: NQ1! <-> ES1! for our futures feed (crypto/FX/metals pairing unchanged).
// Everything else is the original. Education only. Not financial advice.
indicator("WCSMC + SP v3.0 [WinWorld]", shorttitle = "WCSMC + SP v3.0 [WinWorld]", overlay = true, max_lines_count = 500, max_boxes_count = 500, max_labels_count = 500, max_bars_back = 2000)

string G_MAIN = "WCSMC | Main Settings"
string drawFromMode  = input.string("Whole history", "Draw structure...", options = ["Whole history", "From date"], group = G_MAIN, tooltip = "Draw structure across the whole price history, or only from a chosen start date.")
int    drawFromTime  = input.time(timestamp("01 Jan 2026 00:00 +0000"), "Start date", group = G_MAIN)
string idmMode       = input.string("ext-idm", "IDM Mode", options = ["ext-idm", "in-idm"], group = G_MAIN, tooltip = "ext-idm: external inducement, higher-quality liquidity, better reversal odds.\nin-idm: last valid pullback regardless of internal/external - more frequent IDMs.")
bool   showSecIdm    = input.bool(false, "Show Secondary IDM", group = G_MAIN, tooltip = "Shows the other IDM definition in angle brackets, e.g. < in-IDM >, for confluence.")
